"\u003Cp\u003E新一期讀書會\u003Cbr\u003E《別把你的錢留到死》(Die with Zero)\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E顛覆傳統的財務思維：\u003Cbr\u003E。你是否想過，在你死前没把錢花光都是浪費？\u003Cbr\u003E。最佳的金錢策略是甚麼？\u003Cbr\u003E。如何在時間、健康與金錢之間取得平衡？\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E這是一場關於價值觀的革命，是一場重新定義金錢意義的旅程。\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E第一次開卷時間：\u003Cbr\u003E日期：12月14日（星期日）\u003Cbr\u003E時間：15:00-17:00\u003Cbr\u003E地點：廚意\u003Cbr\u003E香港佐敦志和街1號登臺酒店1樓\u003Cbr\u003E費用：至少消費一杯飲品\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E主持人： Polly\u003Cbr\u003E&nbsp;\u003Cbr\u003EPowered by Empower\u003Cbr\u003Ewww.Empower.hk\u003Cbr\u003EFacebook.com\u002FEmpower.hk\u003Cbr\u003EYouTube.com\u002FEmpowerhk\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E◎ 你準備好顛覆傳統，掌握自己的財務命運了嗎？\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","2025-12-14",null,"die_with_zero_251214","2025-11-22T12:27:46.430Z",{"data":10},[11],{"id":12,"attributes":13},1,{"name":14,"slug":15,"description":6,"createdAt":16,"updatedAt":16},"讀書會","book-sharing","2023-02-12T02:38:55.939Z",{"data":18},{"id":19,"attributes":20},81,{"name":21,"alternativeText":6,"caption":6,"width":22,"height":23,"formats":24,"hash":55,"ext":26,"mime":29,"size":56,"url":57,"previewUrl":6,"provider":58,"provider_metadata":6,"createdAt":59,"updatedAt":59},"Brown and White Organic Scrapbook Reading Journal.png",1545,2000,{"large":25,"small":34,"medium":41,"thumbnail":48},{"ext":26,"url":27,"hash":28,"mime":29,"name":30,"path":6,"size":31,"width":32,"height":33},".png","https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Flarge_Brown_and_White_Organic_Scrapbook_Reading_Journal_408df4e296.png","large_Brown_and_White_Organic_Scrapbook_Reading_Journal_408df4e296","image\u002Fpng","large_Brown and White Organic Scrapbook Reading Journal.png",1646.97,773,1000,{"ext":26,"url":35,"hash":36,"mime":29,"name":37,"path":6,"size":38,"width":39,"height":40},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fsmall_Brown_and_White_Organic_Scrapbook_Reading_Journal_408df4e296.png","small_Brown_and_White_Organic_Scrapbook_Reading_Journal_408df4e296"